  "summary": "Leaning back on straight arms with the legs lifted in a V, the legs draw a circle — down to one side, round and up the other — while the chest stays lifted.",
  "steps": [
    "Sit leaning back on the hands, fingers pointing away, chest lifted.",
    "Lift both legs together into a V.",
    "Breathe in to take the legs to one side and down.",
    "Breathe out to bring them round and up the other side. Reverse."
